      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030404,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "之后，他遇到了为了磨炼武艺、向经过桥上的人发起挑战的/n牛若丸，两人便在那里交锋——",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304040320",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030404033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030404,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "结果弁庆战败，成为牛若丸的随从。/n就在两人刚结下羁绊时，名为桥姬的鬼出现了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304040330",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 74,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030404034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030404,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "原来袭击行人的真凶正是桥姬。结成主从关系的牛若丸与弁庆/n合力讨伐潜藏在事件背后的鬼——桥姬，故事就此落幕。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304040340",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030404035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030404,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "原来如此。作为最后的高潮，也给双方都安排了表现空间。/n不过，风格一下子变了啊。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304040350",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
